# The exemptions of the check, as Valgrind suppressions. `fun:` matches mangled symbol names.
#
# The `Option` that an inversion returns discloses whether the input is zero. Each library builds
# that `Option` in `invert::declassify`, a function with a symbol of its own. These entries exempt
# a conditional jump whose innermost frame is that function.
{
   prime-field invert: the Option discloses a zero input
   Memcheck:Cond
   fun:*11prime_field6invert10declassify*
}
{
   binary-field invert: the Option discloses a zero input
   Memcheck:Cond
   fun:*12binary_field6invert10declassify*
}
